        "collapsible_tab_t9AL73": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Online-based Learning",
            "icon": "silhouette",
            "content": "<p>This module is completed online to ensure you can direct your focus to any topic that's important to your needs.</p><ul><li>Revises a Test and Tag Course with interactive videos and state-of-the-art animations</li><li>Updates on all standards and regulations</li><li>Resources for external reading</li><li>A Certificate of Completion to prove your maintaining your ongoing competency</li><li>Personalised help with any topic from our test and tag experts</li><li>One month of unlimited access to the course</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_RUBEc8": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Course Detail",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<p>Once you enrolled and our Test and Tag Training team have confirmed your details, you'll receive an email with your login details and instructions for the course.<br/><br/>You'll have one month of unlimited access to go through the module. If you would like to refresh yourself on just a few different topics, we expect it could take 2-3 hours. However, if you would like a thorough update on the entire course, we estimate it could take up 6 hours to complete. If at any time you require technical help or extra assistance with a particular test and tag topic, our team will be ready to help you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_aUKp3U": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Requirements",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>The Online Refresher Course is used by people that have successfully <br/>completed a Test and Tag Course. This not only applies to Test & Tag<br/> Training students, but to anyone that has completed a course with any <br/>other training provider.</p><p>It doesn't matter if you completed your course a few years ago, or <br/>even just a week ago - this online course will refresh your memory and <br/>make sure your're up-to-date with everything you need to know about <br/>testing and tagging.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_PLAMRG": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits",
