            "content": "<ul><li>Go at your own pace and in your own time</li><li>Refresh your memory on the topics that matter to you</li><li>A truly one-on-one and interactive learning experience</li><li>Ensures your test and tag skills are up-to-date</li><li>Show customers you're maintaining your competency and that you're up-to-date with all standards</li><li>Full professional support from Test & Tag Training</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
