      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_jP3dUU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does the Online Refresher Course cover?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The Online Refresher Course revises topics from the Test and Tag Course using interactive videos and animations. It provides updates on all test and tag standards and regulations. Additionally, it offers personalised assistance from test and tag experts and provides resources for external reading.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_9amYtn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the duration of the Test & Tag Online Refresher Course? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You’ll have access to the Refresher Course for 30 days. If you would like to refresh yourself on just a few different topics, we expect it could take 2-3 hours. However, if you would like a thorough update on the entire course, we estimate it could take up 6 hours to complete.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YAFc4k": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who is eligible to enrol in the Online Refresher Course? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The Online Refresher Course is designed for people who have previously completed a Test and Tag Course, regardless of the training provider. Whether you completed your course recently or many years ago, you can benefit from refreshing your skills and staying up-to-date with industry standards.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DhYd67": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the benefits of taking the Course? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The course allows you to learn at your own pace and in your own time (access for 30 days). It offers a one-on-one interactive learning experience and ensures that your test and tag skills are up-to-date. Completing the course also demonstrates that you are maintaining your competency and staying current with industry standards.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wgai4y": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I need technical support after the Course? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You’ll have the peace of mind knowing that we'll be there when you need us, whether it's by phone, email or in person. Every single student taught by Test & Tag Training receives free lifetime technical support from our team of experts. Guaranteed. This could be anything from how to use a specific appliance tester or how to test and tag a particular electrical appliance. We want to ensure we're making people's jobs easier by offering dependable service and expert advice when you need it most.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
